    "type": "math",
    "question": "প্রমাণ করুন যে, (a + b)^4 - (a - b)^4 = 8ab(a^2 + b^2)",
    "steps": [
      "(a + b)^4 - (a - b)^4",
      "= {(a+b)^2}^2 - {(a-b)^2}^2",
      "= {(a+b)^2 + (a-b)^2} × {(a+b)^2 - (a-b)^2}",
      "= 2(a^2+b^2) × 4ab",
      "= 8ab(a^2 + b^2)"
    ],
    "answer": "(a+b)^4 − (a−b)^4 = 8ab(a²+b²) (প্রমাণিত)"
  },
